### 基础 PromptTemplate（需要有效模型配置）
GET http://localhost:8080/template/basic?topic=太空探险&style=科幻

### 翻译
POST http://localhost:8080/template/translate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "Hello World",
  "source": "英语",
  "target": "中文"
}

### 代码审查
POST http://localhost:8080/template/code-review
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "public int add(int a, int b) { return a + b; }",
  "language": "Java"
}

### ChatClient Fluent 模板
GET http://localhost:8080/template/fluent?name=张三&skill=Java

### 多消息 Prompt
GET http://localhost:8080/template/multi-message?role=Java专家&question=什么是 Spring Boot

### SystemPromptTemplate
GET http://localhost:8080/template/system-template?role=架构师&domain=微服务&question=如何设计服务网格

### 自定义模板分隔符
GET http://localhost:8080/template/custom-delimiter?name=张三&age=25

### 专家系统模板（固定资源、显式 UTF-8）
GET http://localhost:8080/template/expert?expertise=Spring%20AI&question=什么是Prompt

### render 与 create 对比
GET http://localhost:8080/template/render?topic=人工智能

### Token 使用量
GET http://localhost:8080/template/token-usage?question=什么是机器学习

### 批量翻译
POST http://localhost:8080/template/batch-translate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "texts": ["Hello", "Good morning", "Thank you"],
  "source": "英语",
  "target": "中文"
}

### 生成文章
POST http://localhost:8080/template/generate-article
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "topic": "Spring AI 入门",
  "length": 800,
  "style": "技术博客",
  "keywords": ["Spring", "AI", "ChatClient"]
}

### 生成大纲
GET http://localhost:8080/template/generate-outline?topic=微服务架构设计

### 智能客服
POST http://localhost:8080/template/customer-service
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerName": "张三",
  "customerLevel": "VIP",
  "type": "订单查询",
  "message": "我想查询最近的订单状态",
  "orders": [
    {"id": "20240101", "amount": 299.0, "status": "已发货"}
  ]
}

### 参数校验示例：应返回 HTTP 400 中文错误
GET http://localhost:8080/template/basic?topic=&style=科幻

### 缺少参数：应返回 HTTP 400 中文错误
GET http://localhost:8080/template/basic?topic=Spring%20AI

### 畸形 JSON：应返回 HTTP 400 中文错误
POST http://localhost:8080/template/translate
Content-Type: application/json

{

### 参数校验示例：批量列表不能为空
POST http://localhost:8080/template/batch-translate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "texts": [],
  "source": "英语",
  "target": "中文"
}
### 博客主线：预览最终消息，不调用模型
POST http://localhost:8080/template/preview
Content-Type: application/json

{"question":"分析 List<String> 和 JSON：{\"a\":1}","expertise":"Java"}

### 使用与预览相同的输入调用专家助手
POST http://localhost:8080/template/expert
Content-Type: application/json

{"question":"解释构造器注入为什么方便测试","expertise":"Spring Boot"}

